comments.body:
I'm facing the same issue or bluetooth bug with my LG watch style (running wear OS 2.0).
Installing xdrip+ was no problem but it's not possible to receive any data values when it's used as standalone collector. Unfortunately there's no root option available for the watch (and most probably will never be). 
@jamorham please can you let us know if there's any hope or even realistic chance to get this issue fixed (maybe on xdrip+ side?) without touching the rom of the watch? Thanks!
